    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "メイドさんの格好をするなら、\r\nせめてそれらしい所作は知っておこうと思って……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、なるほど\r\n知っておいて損はないもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "で、ですよね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あくまで建物の雰囲気に合わせて、ってお話なので\r\nかしこまる必要はないってわかってるんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……でもあの洋館は\r\n大切にされてたお家なんじゃないかと思って",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だから、\r\nできることはしておきたいなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、えっと……その……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……あの洋館って\r\n家主さんが長く暮らしてたお家だったんですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それを手放してお店にするのって\r\nさみしくないのかなって……考えちゃったんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020160"
  },
  {
    "select": "どうなんだろう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "想像でしかないけど",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "家主さんが……",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなあ、なんというか……\r\n借家の更新で引っ越すのとは、わけが違うもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "で、でも\r\n自分が引っ越すって考えたら",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……やっぱり、さみしいというか\r\n不安な気持ちになりそうです……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……まあ、そうだよなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも、家主さんには\r\n何か手放す理由があったんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……家主さんはご高齢って話だったし、歳を重ねると\r\nそういう判断が必要になることもあるんだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020200"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さみしいって気持ち以上にお店をやりたかったとか……\r\n何か考えがあるのかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "考え……そうですよね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "す、少なくとも、\r\n嫌になったとかじゃなさそうですし……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\n何か前向きな理由があるのかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "前向き……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そうですよね、きっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020240"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ご高齢、って言ってたからなぁ\r\nそういう理由かもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……それは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013020260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "仕方ない、ですよね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201302/2022013020260"
